<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia Aug industrial output falls 19 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>Slovenia Aug industrial output falls 19 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>    SLOVENIAN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT    Aug   July  Aug 95</p>
<p>    Month/month change (pct)	-19.3   +5.8  -2.7</p>
<p>    Yr/yr change (pct)		 -1.8   +6.2  -5.1</p>
<p>    Index (base 1995)		  83.4  103.3  84.9</p>
<p>-- Marja Novak, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
